graph TB
    subgraph LLMDRouter["llm-d Router"]
        subgraph EPPComponent["Endpoint Picker (EPP)"]
            EPP["EPP Controller<br/>controller-runtime + gRPC<br/>9002/TCP ext-proc"]
            PluginFramework["Plugin Framework<br/>60+ built-in plugins"]
            Scheduler["Scheduling Engine<br/>Filter → Score → Pick"]
            EPP --> PluginFramework
            PluginFramework --> Scheduler
        end

        subgraph SidecarComponent["Disaggregation Sidecar (pd-sidecar)"]
            Sidecar["pd-sidecar<br/>HTTP reverse proxy<br/>8000/TCP"]
            KVConnectors["KV Connectors<br/>NIXL v2 / Shared Storage<br/>SGLang / Mooncake / Offloading"]
            Sidecar --> KVConnectors
        end

        subgraph CoordinatorComponent["Coordinator (experimental)"]
            Coordinator["Coordinator<br/>HTTP pipeline orchestrator<br/>8080/TCP"]
            Pipeline["E/P/D Pipeline<br/>encode → prefill → decode"]
            Coordinator --> Pipeline
        end
    end

    %% CRDs
    InferencePoolCR["InferencePool CR<br/>(GIE v1.5.0)"]
    InferenceObjectiveCR["InferenceObjective CR<br/>(llm-d.ai/v1alpha2)"]
    InferenceModelRewriteCR["InferenceModelRewrite CR<br/>(llm-d.ai/v1alpha2)"]

    InferencePoolCR -->|watched by| EPP
    InferenceObjectiveCR -->|watched by| EPP
    InferenceModelRewriteCR -->|watched by| EPP

    %% External integrations
    Client["External Client"] -->|HTTPS/443| EnvoyGW["Envoy Gateway"]
    EnvoyGW -->|ext-proc gRPC/9002<br/>Self-signed TLS| EPP
    EPP -->|selects endpoint| EnvoyGW
    EnvoyGW -->|routes to| ModelServers["vLLM Model Servers<br/>8000/TCP"]

    %% Sidecar flow
    EnvoyGW -->|HTTP/8000| Sidecar
    Sidecar -->|prefill request| PrefillWorker["Prefill Worker<br/>Dynamic port"]
    PrefillWorker -->|KV-cache transfer<br/>NIXL RDMA/61005| DecodePod["Local vLLM Decoder<br/>8200/TCP"]
    Sidecar -->|decode request| DecodePod

    %% Coordinator flow
    Coordinator -->|HTTP/2 /80| InferenceGW["Inference Gateway"]
    Coordinator -->|HTTP/8080| RenderingSvc["Rendering Service"]

    %% Observability
    EPP -->|metrics/9090| Prometheus["Prometheus"]
    EPP -.->|traces/4317| OTLP["OTLP Collector"]

    %% Kubernetes API
    EPP -->|watch CRDs + Pods| K8sAPI["Kubernetes API<br/>443/TCP"]
    Sidecar -->|watch InferencePool| K8sAPI

